Dialogue: 3,0:00:05.70,0:00:09.95,Black,Instructor,0,0,0,,Beleza! Vamos começar o treinamento de ninja!
Dialogue: 3,0:00:10.23,0:00:11.12,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Ok~!
Dialogue: 3,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.95,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,Mal posso esperar.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:13.45,0:00:18.51,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Vamos nos esforçar para virar ninjas e poder usar artes ninjas!
Dialogue: 3,0:00:19.02,0:00:23.71,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,Eu quero tentar técnicas de desaparecimento e clones da sombra.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:23.71,0:00:25.20,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Nin, nin!
Dialogue: 3,0:00:25.20,0:00:26.16,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,Nin.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:32.14,0:00:34.23,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Lá vou eu!
Dialogue: 3,0:00:34.23,0:00:35.39,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Tome isto!
Dialogue: 3,0:00:37.33,0:00:38.25,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Ué?
Dialogue: 3,0:00:39.52,0:00:41.70,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,Neste caso, deixe-me...
Dialogue: 3,0:00:42.52,0:00:43.90,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,Tome isto! Hah!
Dialogue: 3,0:00:50.29,0:00:53.02,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Uau, a sua voou tão longe, Kris!
Dialogue: 3,0:00:53.02,0:00:54.66,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,Realmente.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:54.66,0:00:56.31,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:03.67,0:01:05.39,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Kris!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:06.95,0:01:08.26,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Estou aqui!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:08.25,0:01:08.29,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,{=62}{\fscx100\fscy100\frz0\bord4\alpha&H00&\pos(960,1020)}Estou aqui!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:08.29,0:01:08.33,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,{=62}{\fscx100\fscy100\frz0\bord4\alpha&H00&\pos(960,1020)}Estou aqui!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:08.33,0:01:08.38,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,{=62}{\fscx100.88\fscy100.88\frz0\bord4.04\alpha&H00&\pos(949.28,1025.7)}Estou aqui!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:08.38,0:01:08.42,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,{=62}{\fscx104.41\fscy104.41\frz0\bord4.18\alpha&H00&\pos(908.62,1048.23)}Estou aqui!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:08.42,0:01:08.46,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,{=62}{\fscx113.03\fscy113.03\frz0\bord4.52\alpha&H00&\pos(809.09,1103.5)}Estou aqui!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:09.72,0:01:12.35,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,O-o que é isso?
Dialogue: 3,0:01:12.35,0:01:15.14,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Aparentemente é chamado de parede giratória.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:16.23,0:01:18.27,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Vamos, tente também!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:24.52,0:01:26.21,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(960,1012)}Kris~
Dialogue: 3,0:01:29.89,0:01:31.03,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Quem está aí?!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:31.61,0:01:32.80,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,Ali?!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:36.68,0:01:38.45,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,{\t(1459,1793,1,\c&H000000&)}Foi só minha imaginação?
Dialogue: 3,0:01:41.82,0:01:43.99,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Isso foi bem divertido, não foi?
Dialogue: 3,0:01:43.99,0:01:44.91,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:50.00,0:01:54.78,Black,Agnes Digital,0,0,0,,Minhas oshis em uma roupa diferente... O moe... É demais!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:54.78,0:01:55.76,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Digital-chan?
Dialogue: 3,0:01:56.76,0:02:00.43,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,Então aquela presença que eu senti... era você?
Dialogue: 3,0:02:00.43,0:02:02.69,Black,Agnes Digital,0,0,0,,M-me desculpe!
Dialogue: 3,0:02:02.69,0:02:07.23,Black,Agnes Digital,0,0,0,,V-vocês estavam tão moe que eu não pude...!
Dialogue: 3,0:02:07.58,0:02:11.69,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,É incrível que você foi capaz de esconder sua presença!
Dialogue: 3,0:02:12.76,0:02:13.87,Black,Agnes Digital,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 3,0:02:13.87,0:02:16.62,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,Você é uma ninja de verdade.
Dialogue: 3,0:02:16.62,0:02:18.02,Black,Agnes Digital,0,0,0,,Erm...
Dialogue: 3,0:02:18.02,0:02:19.62,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Como esperado de uma ninja!
Dialogue: 3,0:02:19.88,0:02:21.46,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,Ninjas são incríveis!
Dialogue: 3,0:02:21.46,0:02:23.17,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Ninjas são fantásticas!
Dialogue: 3,0:02:23.17,0:02:24.37,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,Ninjas são admiráveis!
Dialogue: 3,0:02:24.37,0:02:26.46,Black,Fine Motion,0,0,0,,Ninjas são muito, muito maneiras!
Dialogue: 3,0:02:26.46,0:02:28.96,Black,Agnes Digital,0,0,0,,{\t(1896,2522,1,\c&H000000&)}Que honra!
Comment: 0,0:02:28.96,0:02:31.96,Black,,0,0,0,,
